{"unit_id":"OwlNjust__dsh-peer-sessions#card-zh","repo":"OwlNjust/dsh-peer-sessions","commit":"10f6f49690d7791dfe15a95a959e9b85e0e5bf4d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-peer-sessions 是面向 DSH Web 配置的会话协作插件，让用户授权的同级对话互相发送消息并查看进度。它通过一个 composition row 注册 /peers、/peer 命令和 peer_send、peer_inbox、peer_progress、peer_list 工具。用户可连接或撤销会话频道，按通知、请求、回复或普通消息交接工作，读取收件箱和对方近期进度；忙碌对话会在当前轮结束后收到消息。适合并行处理相关任务、同步接口变化或让两个独立会话互相答复。代码不要求额外 API key 或外部服务；频道授权记录写入会话日志。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:94-125","lib/tools.js:94-104","lib/commands.js:127-179","lib/grants.js:54-61"]}
{"unit_id":"OwlNjust__dsh-peer-sessions#card-en","repo":"OwlNjust/dsh-peer-sessions","commit":"10f6f49690d7791dfe15a95a959e9b85e0e5bf4d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-peer-sessions links approved DSH peer sessions. Commands connect, list, inspect, and revoke channels; tools send messages, read inboxes, and show progress. Messages wait until a busy peer finishes its turn. No API key or external service is needed; grants are recorded in session logs.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:94-125","lib/tools.js:94-104","lib/commands.js:127-179","lib/grants.js:54-61"]}
