{"unit_id":"OwlNjust__dsh-peer-sessions#feature-1","repo":"OwlNjust/dsh-peer-sessions","commit":"10f6f49690d7791dfe15a95a959e9b85e0e5bf4d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-peer-sessions 的功能「同级会话消息」：模型可用 peer_send 向已连接的对话发送通知、请求、回复或普通消息，并附摘要、正文和可选路径。接收方正在忙时，消息排队到当前轮结束后送达。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:94-104","lib/tools.js:140-168","lib/tools.js:203-206"]}
