{"unit_id":"OwlNjust__dsh-peer-sessions#feature-3","repo":"OwlNjust/dsh-peer-sessions","commit":"10f6f49690d7791dfe15a95a959e9b85e0e5bf4d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-peer-sessions 的功能「收件箱」：模型调用 peer_inbox 可先查看消息摘要，也可按消息 id 读取完整正文；收到的请求和答复状态会显示在列表中。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:228-320"]}
{"unit_id":"OwlNjust__dsh-peer-sessions#feature-4","repo":"OwlNjust/dsh-peer-sessions","commit":"10f6f49690d7791dfe15a95a959e9b85e0e5bf4d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-peer-sessions 的功能「对方进度」：用户可运行 /peer progress <title>，模型也可调用 peer_progress，查看同一工作区会话的投影摘要和近期进度。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/commands.js:127-179","lib/tools.js:322-344"]}
{"unit_id":"OwlNjust__dsh-peer-sessions#caveat-1","repo":"OwlNjust/dsh-peer-sessions","commit":"10f6f49690d7791dfe15a95a959e9b85e0e5bf4d","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-peer-sessions 使用前须知：频道授权会写入批准方的会话日志；收件箱和待处理消息状态保存在进程内存中，重启后不会保留。（见 lib/grants.js:54-61、lib/store.js:147-174）","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/grants.js:54-61","lib/store.js:147-174"]}
